MATTHEW KAPHAN (funky@nevada.edu) wrote:
: What is the method to keep nymphs from stealing things from me, and 
: lepracauns also?  I just started playing the game, and I'm having a lot
: of trouble staying alive unless i'm in exploratory mode.  Any hints to help
: me out?

1) Genocide them.  A blessed scroll of Genocide works best because you
can genocide a whole class of monsters (like 'n's or 'l's).

2) Zap them with wands or spells of cancellation.  That robs them of
thier special powers.

3) Don't carry anything that they can steal.  This is a better defense
against lepracauns than nymphs for obvious reasons.
